{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FSECylRbBF1793788237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有報道指，本港新股市況明顯放緩。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》統計顯示，本港今年來已有78隻新股延遲或撤回上市，相當於每4宗新股，就有1宗沒完成招股，較以往每年平均3宗高，雖然單計首三季，已有逾110隻新股掛牌，集資3,800多億元，打破歷年同期紀錄，不過近期已明顯降溫，個別大型新股也削減集資額，估計與股市疲弱及當局打擊招股造假活動有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.780321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:31.906722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:35.534310+00:00","content_hash":"b4d2716ea415065e8aeecda4e41fba7df006810171fca2502b08b7c766915211","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}